{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"26e8c21b-98c6-44d3-8820-453410e0da59","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A regular five-pointed star has five identical tips, equally spaced around its center. Rotational symmetry means turning it until it matches its original outline.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Rotational symmetry"},{"op":"figure","id":"star","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-3.8,3.8],"y":[-3.8,3.8],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"group","rotate":72,"repeat":5,"origin":[0,0],"marks":[{"kind":"polyline","points":[[0,3],[-0.673542,0.927051],[-2.85317,0.927051]]}]},{"kind":"point","id":"center","at":[0,0],"label":"O"}],"meaning":"A regular five-pointed star with five equally spaced tips."}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"26e8c21b-98c6-44d3-8820-453410e0da59","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Turn about the center until one tip reaches the next. Five equal turns make a full circle, so the smallest matching turn is seventy-two degrees.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"turn","on":"star","marks":[{"kind":"point","id":"tip_a","at":[0,3]},{"kind":"point","id":"tip_b","at":[-2.85317,0.927051]},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"center"},"to":{"at":"tip_a"},"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"segment","from":{"at":"center"},"to":{"at":"tip_b"},"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"center"},"from":{"at":"tip_a"},"to":{"at":"tip_b"},"r":0.22,"label":"72°"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"smallest","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"\\text{Smallest turn}=\\frac{360^\\circ}{5}=72^\\circ"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"What is the smallest positive rotation that makes this regular star match itself?","expected_gist":"72 degrees about its center"}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"26e8c21b-98c6-44d3-8820-453410e0da59","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Each additional seventy-two-degree turn matches again. Counting the full turn, there are five matching positions: the star has rotational symmetry of order five.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"cycle","on":"star","marks":[{"kind":"group","rotate":72,"repeat":5,"origin":[0,0],"marks":[{"kind":"arc","center":{"at":"center"},"r":3.3,"start":90,"end":162,"arrow":true}]}]},{"op":"equation","id":"matches","anchor":{"el":"smallest","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"72^\\circ,\\ 144^\\circ,\\ 216^\\circ,\\ 288^\\circ,\\ 360^\\circ"},{"op":"equation","id":"order","anchor":{"el":"matches","side":"below","gap":0.12},"latex":"\\text{Order}=\\frac{360^\\circ}{72^\\circ}=5"}],"checkpoint":null}}
